Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:48.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Koi no shunkan umarekawaru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:51.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Aozora to kimi dake na no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:56.91,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}(Turtledove  shuua Turtledove padupaa)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:07.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Nee, hanasaku michi o yurasu futari no kage ni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:13.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Choppiri furete kossori tokimeku kokoro
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:19.31,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Mou itsumo sono kao yasashii donkan na egao
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:23.90,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Kekkyoku kidzukanai desho? Gakkari kyou mo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:30.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Lan, Lan koi no suteppu Tu, Tu kanademashou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:33.32,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}"Motto shiritai" "chikazukitai" "watashi o mite" "kimochi ni kizuite!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:36.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Shining, Charming, Blooming, Be mine！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:44.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Kimi no koto kimi no koto "suki!" tte sakebitai nda
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:50.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Watashi dake watashi dake furimuite waratte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:55.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Fushigi da ne kimi o omoeba sekai wa irodzuiteku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:02:01.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Mada mada mada mada kono mama owarasenai yo koi o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:04.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Unmei no hito meguriaeta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:07.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Zutto zutto soba ni iru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:10.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1}Motto egao misete ne
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:48.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Aşık olduğum an yeniden doğarım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:51.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Sadece sen ve mavi gökyüzü.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:07.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Hey, çiçek açan yolda sallanan iki gölgemiz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:13.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Küçük bir dokunuş, gizlice... kalbimi titretiyor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:19.31,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Hep o ifade, o yumuşak, hoş gülümseme
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:23.90,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Fark etmeyeceksin, değil mi? Bugün de hayal kırıklığı.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:30.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Lan Lan hadi aşkın adımını oynayalım Tu Tu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:33.32,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}"Daha fazlasını bilmek istiyorum", "Yaklaşmak istiyorum",\N "Bana bak", "Lütfen duygularımı fark et!"
Dialogue: 9,0:01:33.32,0:01:36.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:44.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Senden hoşlanıyorum. Senden hoşlanıyorum. "Seni seviyorum!" diye bağırmak istiyorum
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:50.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Sadece benim, sadece benim, arkanı dön ve gülümse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:55.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Garip. Seni düşündüğümde dünya renkleniyor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:02:01.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Daha çok yolumuz var, aşkımın böyle bitmesine izin vermem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:04.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Hayallerimin erkeğiyle tanıştım.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:07.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Sonsuza kadar yanında olacağım
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:10.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1\an2}Lütfen bana gülümsemeni daha çok göster
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Soyokaze no you ni sore wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:23.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Sukima wo nadete warau
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:28.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Kawaru gawaru mainichi wo irodotteiku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:31.87,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Terasareta you na ki ga shita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:34.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Doko ni demo aru mainichi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:39.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Kono te ni tewatasareta you ni omoeta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:42.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Yawarakaku warau kimi no soba de
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:45.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Boku ni dekiru koto sagashiteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.39,0:22:48.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Kokoro ni tomotta kono ondo wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:52.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Mamotteitainda, tawai mo nai kono hibi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:55.88,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Dakishimetai to omou no wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:58.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Itsumademo kono keshiki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.55,0:23:01.44,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Anata to waratteitai kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:04.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Inori wa kaze ni nosete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:07.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Anata no yobu koe no hou e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:10.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Katachi no nai kakegae nai omoi wa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:14.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}Itsuka kotoba ni natteite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Hafif bir esinti gibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:23.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}aralıklardan geçip gülümser
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:28.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Sürekli değişen günleri renklendirip
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:31.87,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}onları canlı kılar
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:34.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Aydınlatılıyormuşum gibi hissettim
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:39.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Sanki her sıradan gün bana verilmiş gibi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:42.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Yumuşak gülümsemenle yanında
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:45.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Yapabileceğim bir şey arıyorum
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.39,0:22:48.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Bu sıcaklığı korumak istiyorum,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}kalbime yerleşen
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:55.88,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Bu önemsiz günleri kucaklamak istiyorum
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:58.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5\an3}Çünkü her zaman...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.55,0:23:01.44,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5\an3}...bu manzarada seninle gülmek istiyorum
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:04.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Dualarımı rüzgâra salıyorum,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:07.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}sesinin geldiği yöne
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:10.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}Bu şekilsiz, yeri doldurulamaz duygular,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:14.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}bir gün kelimelere dönüşecek
